          "en": "to simply add those extra links here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 205.26,
          "end": 208.323,
          "en": "which import fonts from Google Fonts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 209.19,
          "end": 213.183,
          "en": "That's the only change I made with that index.html file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 214.11,
          "end": 218.88,
          "en": "Well, and with all that done, we now improved the styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 218.88,
          "end": 221.88,
          "en": "and therefore, as a last step, you should go",
